WEBVTT

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.370
All right,then.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:02.450
Good morning, great Babylon.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.620
It's turned out to be
a good era. Don't you agree?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.500
Sister Kate!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:16.300
The central executives of the Magdalene
Order have called an emergency meeting.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.710
Please hurry.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.050
I'll take care of things here.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.130
All right, please do.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.680
Minister, is the situation really that...

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.100
There are still too many uncertain elements.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.640
This same phenomenon
is happening at every church,

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:36.110
and a black sun and
red moon have been observed.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:39.030
There are a great many
things which worry me.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.530
A red moon!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.030
I've seen the red moon.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.410
It's just like before. Aion has come.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.080
What the heck?

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.970
The first angel sounded his trumpet,

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.730
and there came hail
and fire mixed with blood,

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.600
and it was hurled down upon the Earth.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:20.190
A third of the Earth was burned up,

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.240
and all the green grass was burned up.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:28.530
Aion is incredible, isn't he?
I wanted to see the red hail too.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.040
If it would please you,
would you like to go to Manhattan?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:36.960
Lord Aion did say that it
would be enjoyable if you came too.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.260
I hate cities.
The noise of the crowds is too strong.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:46.340
Forgive me. I said too much.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.680
It's all right.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.810
By the way, there are a lot of carrots here.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.100
An unbalanced diet is bad for your health.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.100
Lord Joshua?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.980
It's the scent of tainted meat.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:07.160
The sun turned black like a
sackcloth made of goat hair,

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:10.410
the whole moon turned blood red,

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.040
and the stars in the sky fell to earth,

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:20.090
as late figs drop from a fig tree
when shaken by a strong wind.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:24.010
The sky receded like a scroll, rolling up.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.430
As you are well aware, Manhattan,

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.730
and especially
the area known as Central Park,

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.730
is an extremely important place
when it comes to spiritual matters.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.980
The predecessors of the
Magdalene Order learned that this place

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.900
was connected to
the limbo of Pandemonium,

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.910
and worked hard to put up
a seal to act as a protective boundary.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.660
We believe that the current
outbreak of the appearance of the dead

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.000
is being caused by the seal being broken,

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.170
and we've deduced that the red hail from
this morning was intended to break that seal.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:07.970
Sister Kate, we want you to quickly go
and restore the Seal of the Seven Wings.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.390
Understood.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.430
Please wait!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.760
I'm going too.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.480
You don't know how frightening Aion is.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.440
You know he's after the Apostles!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:24.780
My younger brother is
an Apostle too, so Aion kidnapped him.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.530
At the least, I want to protect you.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.660
I'm tired of being protected all of the time!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.620
I'm going to fight too!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.660
Get in.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.330
The blockade of the park
using spiritual power is complete.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.340
All that's left is to seal the pit of miasma.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.340
We're going to restore
the Seal of the Seven Wings.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.970
Everyone, go to your assigned coordinates,

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.720
and contact me
as you finish your preparations.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.180
Rosette still isn't here.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.390
Oh, that girl.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.430
Late at a time like this?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.440
Everyone else, do your duty.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.480
Yes, Sir!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.070
Sorry, Minister Remington!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.530
Rosette!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.360
If you get covered in that, you'll die!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.950
It's just as Chrono says.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:17.750
The miasma is evil that has accumulated
in Pandemonium and gained form.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.210
It has already claimed many victims.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.290
Minister, what do you mean by evil?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.710
People's hearts.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.590
Hearts?

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.250
People's malice, greed.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.220
The stagnation of instinct
becomes the fodder for devils.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.880
That sounds disgusting.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.510
So something like that is under Manhattan?

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.270
Even though we say below, it doesn't
literally mean it's inside the ground.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.230
You guys hurry to
your positions too, please.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.100
Understood.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.310
Here you go.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.270
You use these just like you
use the <i>Principatus</i> class, okay?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.320
Okay.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.860
Chrono, Azmaria!
Hurry up and get that barrier up!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:52.860
Right!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.750
Man, just one after another.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.790
I'm finished!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.210
All right, just one more!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.170
Right!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.670
Here.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.510
Let's hurry!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.390
Rosette!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:24.900
Chrono!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.280
Take form...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.650
...drops from the jewels!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:39.950
Rain down, like the thunderstorm
that tears the ground apart!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.960
The clear February!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.470
It looks like you're in the middle
of another close fight, as always.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.850
Satella, why are you here?

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.480
I got a request from
the New York Police Department.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.690
Maybe you guys aren't
actually trusted after all.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:16.530
Shut up, the NYPD has too little integrity!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.530
Whatever, hurry up and put up the barrier.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.620
That kind of thing is
outside my area of expertise after all.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.910
I know that!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.710
Chrono, Azmaria, let's get to work!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.540
He's here!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.500
What?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.970
He's arrived.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.870
This feeling...

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.960
A devil!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.800
Me?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.180
I am the Alpha and the Omega.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.350
The beginning and the end.
The start and the finish.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.680
Aion!!

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:32.230
I thought that you would be
able to tell that I was coming.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.070
Laden!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.570
Reveal your form, <i>ritters juwel!</i>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.570
Don't, Satella! He isn't a normal...

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.740
...devil, all of whom must be destroyed!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:00.220
What an admirable
thing you just did, Chrono.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.430
Chrono!

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.980
What happened to the Chrono that was
trying to change Pandemonium with me?

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.350
Come back with me.
Let's work together again.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.440
The world of the humans isn't so bad, is it?

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:23.320
The reason we can live is because of the
never-ending greed of this world, this nation.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.580
Try and devote yourself to it too.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.950
Don't put me in the same boat as you.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.080
I see.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.670
Chrono!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.510
Hey there, Rosette Christopher.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.590
You've certainly grown
into a lovely young lady.

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.180
Where's Joshua?!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.260
Are you going to shoot if I don't answer?

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.890
Who's the one that
knows Joshua's whereabouts?

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.480
Rosette...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.730
You're so reliable, Mary of Magdalene.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.780
But I have come to get someone.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.200
Come on out, young Apostle girl.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:09.450
All of the disasters that have
occurred today are for your welcoming party.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.960
Group three,
barrier preparations are complete.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.010
Group five, preparations are complete.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.840
Group six, preparations are complete.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:27.800
Understood. All groups,
stand by and maintain your positions.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.350
Minister, Rosette still isn't...

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.190
Oh, what in the world is that girl doing?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.820
Don't look away, you two!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.280
Rosette, you're mistaken.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.500
I saved Joshua.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.880
You saved him?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.630
Rosette, don't listen!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.960
The one who desires to kill all devils,

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:07.220
and the young Apostle girl...

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:08.970
Listen.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.470
All of this is His fault!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.270
The many tragedies
that have happened to you,

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:20.190
all of them were traps
set up by the one you call God.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:25.110
Rosette Christopher, have you
ever heard his voice, even once?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.240
Rosette, you mustn't listen!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.160
Chrono!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.870
Stop it!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.080
I need clues to Joshua,
to my younger brother's whereabouts!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.420
But there's no way a devil would help you!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.210
Please!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.800
Please, Satella!

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.890
Isn't this fun?
Even at a time as painful as this,

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:54.310
there is not even a word from
the one you worship to save you!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.690
This is it, this is the reality of the world.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.440
He sees nothing. He saves no one!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.990
You understand,
don't you, young Apostle girl?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.780
While you were
presented with the blessing of light,

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.570
what you carry with
you every day is despair.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.290
Such hypocrisy as well as deception.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.410
He is a minor villain that uses
both violence and kind words,

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.500
and who has grown fat on His own conceit.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:26.340
Your wandering travels to find
a place where your heart could be at peace

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.340
must have been tough, young Apostle girl.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:32.600
And you, the jewel witch
who spent over ten years,

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:36.640
without any clues,
searching for the family that you lost.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.480
It must have been painful.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.940
I am able to save you from His curse.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:50.740
Do you understand?
This is why I saved Joshua.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.120
Don't say such selfish things!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.540
You're pointing
your gun at the wrong person.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.750
The one you truly
need to defeat is in Heaven.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.500
And though I say that,

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:05.920
creatures such as
yourselves cannot defeat Him.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.010
But I can, right, Chrono?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:13.850
Isn't that why we
accepted being branded as Sinners?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.310
Chrono!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.650
Let us work together, humans.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:36.830
Apostle, for that purpose, I need your power.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.450
Azmaria Hendric...

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.380
I want to save you.

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.600
Cut it out. It's not like you can even fire.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.710
I won't hand Azmaria over to you!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.380
Even though you handed Joshua over?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:39.720
Poor Rosette Christopher.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.310
But I can save you.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.150
Rosette...

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:53.900
Give yourself over to me, Mary of Magdalene.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.580
Rosette!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.510
Get away from Rosette!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.560
The miasma is...

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.770
Chrono?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.070
That's right.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.370
Now, spread your
Sinner's wings once more, Chrono!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.710
Aion!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.430
Stop it, Chrono!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.690
Please stop!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.690
Please...

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.490
Azmaria...

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.320
I'll go.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:23.030
So, please don't hurt
Rosette and the others!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:28.870
Just as I expected of the Apostle of Charity,
who has received God's blessing.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.500
No, Azmaria.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.880
If you do that, it's no different than before!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.720
Shall we go, Apostle?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.710
Seal it!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.030
Azmaria!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.960
Did that finish him?

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.720
No, he's sure to come again.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:04.430
Because that wasn't the real Aion.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.430
So that's what happens with a shadow?

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.140
For you to go so far as
sending out the Holy Mother...

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:15.520
Pretty sly of You.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.480
Maybe I'll go about
this in a roundabout way.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:23.030
Chrono, I'll leave that Apostle to you.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.780
The restoration of
the barrier was successful.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.910
There is just one problem.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:33.330
The secret plans of the Sinners,
and their close connections...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.380
There is also the sealed third prophecy.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:40.000
We must carefully
fathom the Lord's intentions.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.010
That is... He's had another fit.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.260
I'm looking forward to it, Fi.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:55.520
I want to meet the other Apostles soon.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:59.020
It looks like I'm not good enough.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.070
It seems that his true older sister...
